            {
                "entry_id": "dd2b8987-3c57-32ee-918b-458058823b26",
                "word": "Styler",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "518dbf15-bd05-47df-80bf-fff634e6ff27",
                        "entry_id": "dd2b8987-3c57-32ee-918b-458058823b26",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Stylers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                        "entry_id": "dd2b8987-3c57-32ee-918b-458058823b26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fan of English singer, songwriter, and actor Harry Styles (born 1994)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1f5deb6-faf0-442b-b43b-fc5c84492fd4",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "Ok, so Harry Styles (and his pet chicken) might have had something to do with the influx of Directioners and Stylers hungry for battered and deep-fried salvation but the Florence-based house’s output has helped it become the hottest brand of today."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90dc7eb4-398f-4c98-bb99-b5d56e112fa9",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "The mag won’t drop for another two weeks but the Stylers are beyond excited about seeing a topless Harry – and at getting a sneak peek of the interview."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "880dd4fe-ffa9-448e-b260-14caa1109fbe",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "CALLING ALL STYLERS! How much do you know about Harry? Take this quiz to find out!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33320fdb-89d9-4591-a6bf-d3f9cf645c47",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "Stylers swooned over the Grammy winner cuddling a cute fan-to-be between takes of making his “As It Was” music video […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9e0dfd3-308f-428a-bdcf-55cda88b6cf6",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "World No.11 [Andrey] Rublev is such a Styler he has twice been to see the British superstar in concert at Madison Square Garden."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "135f2529-8d73-4f41-98a4-61c74d122592",
                                "sense_id": "dc5da4c7-9787-37cd-b32e-18bfdaf92ce4",
                                "text": "Doesn’t HS bestride the pop world like a colossus in a sequined jumpsuit/sheer pussy-bow blouse/boa? / He does. New dates in 2023 for the 28-year-old’s ‘Love on Tour’ have been leapt upon by his legions of ‘Stylers’. […] Surely the Stylers aren’t going to desert poor Harry… are they? / Not yet, but [Timothée] Chalamet’s star is in the ascendant. And Gen Z are so fickle. Is there really room on the red carpet for more than one man in a backless halterneck?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
